        "summary": "SMM behaviour with slow magnetization relaxation under zero dc field; two relaxation modes (slow/fast) related to distinct Dy sites. χT(300 K)=42.4 cm3 K mol−1 decreasing to 18.4 cm3 K mol−1 at 1.8 K. Relaxation modelled with competing Raman, QTM, Direct and Orbach-like processes; Orbach barriers 38 K (single-mode), 37 K (τS) and 77 K (τF).",
